+# Harness audit — ledger: delegated development, migrations and deployment
+
+**Scope**: AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, docs/, Makefile, tools/, deploy/, .github/workflows/, .golangci.yml, httpapi guardrail, .harness/ · **Date**: 2026-11-14 · **Items inventoried**: 19
+
+## 1. Summary
+
+- **Health score**: 31 — the guardrails in place (archcheck, idempotency key) are solid, but several serious rules hold only by the text, one of which has already cost data.
+- **Result of the "cut the agent" test**: FAILED — 6 rules or steps hold only through AGENTS.md (5 entirely, 1 through a check that is not required).
+- **Blocking points (P1)**: 1
+- **The three actions that change things the most**:
+  1. Have `make reset-db` / `make migrate` refuse any non-local database (P1, incident of February 3, 2026).
+  2. Prevent `deploy.yml` from applying from a branch other than `main` and make the `migrations` job required.
+  3. Hold the "no float" rule with a blocking check, after fixing `internal/app/fees.go`.
+
+Computation: 100 − 25 (1 P1) − 40 (5 P2) − 4 (2 P3) = 31.
+
